      "decision": "revise",
      "sourceRowFinding": "HH31 original is a nominal disposal/recycling item. Current sourceText preserves it without inserting a literal assessment verb; current metadata transparently calls bewerten in title/description a derived BNE-supported teaching operation. The surrounding BNE scope supports that derivation. Common course scope is appropriate.",
      "carrierDecision": "accepted for f9e6d689-6e59-59a4-9f21-8c2d44413244 as a bounded environmental disposal/recycling operationalization",
      "narrowerObligations": "Both batteries AND accumulators must remain covered; collection, actual material recovery and remaining environmental consequences are distinct. Current f9 P covers both without inventing industrial reaction-mechanism obligations.",
      "broaderUnion": "c8844ac6 additionally requires galvanic-cell function, primary-cell redox, numerical device suitability and battery-type comparison. The neighbouring HH cell/battery content can justify that elsewhere, but the disposal nominal item does not itself require the entire primary-cell competence.",
      "specificDelta": "Keep literal-source versus derived-operator distinction and the broad SkillPilot target if independently justified; qualify/rebind c884 as topical/other-clause support before claiming full-union clearance from this single item. No need to falsely remove the derived evaluation operation.",
      "primaryPages": [
        31
      ]
