        "primary/dcc123a0291510ae149c98a2129fef196fa76686174859cca24b96e03a1de769/Chemie_Gymnasium_11_12_Erprobungsfassung.pdf"
      ],
      "decision": "revise",
      "sourceRowFinding": "Original MV physical32/printed28 requires discussing environmental issues in disposal, extraction of RARE METALS and recycling. The current paraphrase in sourceText/rawSourceText/parentBulletText omits the explicit rare-metals restriction and the disposal locus. MV physical5 says the right column contains hints AND binding necessary/sufficient depth information; its location is not permission to dismiss this discussion as optional. The paragraph is not LK grey.",
      "carrierDecision": "accepted for the complementary f54b2c33-11f1-571f-aa1c-cf969cc141c4 and f9e6d689-6e59-59a4-9f21-8c2d44413244 as source-duty carriers",
      "narrowerObligations": "Keep rare-metal extraction distinct from recycling, with disposal-related environment. f54 covers source-specific raw-material arguments, not all metallurgy; f9 covers battery/accumulator disposal and recovery.",
      "broaderUnion": "c8844ac6 adds cell-operation and primary-battery engineering/selection scope not required by this one discussion sentence. Its presence can remain broader target context, not full official credit from this sentence.",
