      "decision": "HOLD",
      "sourceRowFinding": "SN physical24/printed12 has a low-demand Einblick main objective about everyday acid significance/use/handling plus a LEFT nested mandatory experimentelles Untersuchen von sauren Loesungen mit Indikatoren. The right-side acid-class/acid-rain remarks are recommendations under the explicit rule on physical4. Current officialCompetencyRow flattens both columns into a single undifferentiated authoritative sentence and assigns GK_LK although this is Klassenstufe8.",
      "carrierDecision": "accepted only for e5d6de7e everyday explanatory facet; current d2ccd1d5 supports interpretation of supplied indicator observations but does not discharge the actual experimental sub-duty",
      "narrowerObligations": "The mandatory indicator investigation is not fulfilled by reading supplied colour data. d2 P case1 says the teacher provides observations; case2 expressly says only safely supplied data are evaluated. None of the other six whole mapped targets supplies learner performance of this indicator investigation. An image of pipetting is no experimental performance contract.",
      "broaderUnion": "Brønsted proton-pair/water-ampholyte theory (1c1420c2), delocalized-electron indicator theory (34da1a4c), O2/CO2/H2 tests (580b3616), particle neutralisation/antacid/disposal (88ee181f) and H3O/OH particle characterization (fd309753) are not entailed by this introductory row. Some may be justified by later/neighbouring source rows, which is separate evidence. The right-column class/acid-rain remarks must not become universal mandatory new atoms.",
      "specificDelta": "Separate mandatory objective and experimental sub-duty from recommended remarks, preserve stage8/Einblick scope, and provide an explicitly bound current experimental indicator carrier/profile route before full source duty acceptance. Alternatively an explicitly narrower source facet could be reviewed separately, but silently discarding the left mandatory experimental sub-duty is not acceptable. Retain actual experimental HOLD; do not satisfy it with source hashes, D/P keep or hypothetical paper performance.",
      "primaryPages": [
        4,
        24
      ]
    }
  ],
  "HB97CountAndGranularity": {
