    "question": "Can 97 current HB extracted source goals and their granularity be accepted as a scientifically faithful whole official source inventory?",
    "answer": "No present completeness/granularity acceptance. The supplied list really contains97 current bodies, but the official PDF does not define97 atomic learning goals. A curated compression could in principle have97 entries; it must declare compression and preserve every mandatory clause, optional status and course boundary through a traceable matrix. Current officialCompetencyBullet labels/rawText and omissions do not establish that. Neither similarity to another subject count nor a matching hash is scientific acceptance.",
    "officialReading": "Read the entire actual41-page HB primary PDF through full layout text; visually checked the binding thick/thin frame rule on15, real protein page27, Energetik30, Elektrochemie31, Kunststoffe34, Farbstoffe35, Natur/Wirkstoffe36 and compulsory-choice table37. Reviewed all97 current source bodies and all20 supplied passage bodies against that original, including editorial summaries.",
    "officialScope": "HB15/21: thick frames are mandatory subject competencies/terms/process competencies; thin frames are optional contexts/experiments/Vertiefungen. HB37: all courses must cover1.1,1.2,1.3,3.1,3.2,3.3,4.1. LK must additionally cover4.3. From2.1,2.2,2.3,4.2 choose one topic GK/two LK. SkillPilot can intentionally target more authored topics without converting this official choice or thin-frame material into universal official duties.",
    "findings": [
