        "issue": "068 is GK_LK for quantitative Faraday laws; original31 expressly puts Faraday calculations under LK. 069 bundles fuel-cell evaluation into common official scope although fuel cells are in optional Vertiefungen. Mandatory LK redox titration and overvoltage are not explicitly carried by the97 source bodies; neither common cell explanation nor Nernst alone replaces them.",
